{"id":"0bde46949efca63c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code.md","title":"ZFC Desc Borel Code","display":"df-zfc-desc-borel-code — ZFC Desc Borel Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-borel-code — ZFC Desc Borel Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-tree]]","[[58-df-well-founded]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-countable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-borel-code — ZFC Desc Borel Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"58-df-well-founded\">58-df-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,X,\\mathcal B,T,R,L,t,Y\\in V\">\\(c,X,\\mathcal B,T,R,L,t,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> have the signatures in the cited sources.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Child}:V^3\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Child}:V^3\\to V\\)</span> is the immediate-successor operator defined here, with order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,R,t)\">\\((T,R,t)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code\\text{-}children}\\vdash\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in T:\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R\\land t\\neq s\\land\n\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(u\\neq t\\land u\\neq s\\land\n\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle u,s\\rangle\\in R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code\\text{-}children}\\vdash\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in T:\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R\\land t\\neq s\\land\n\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(u\\neq t\\land u\\neq s\\land\n\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle u,s\\rangle\\in R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S(c,X,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\n\\exists T,R,L,Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nc=\\langle T,R,L\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{WF}\n(\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\},T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,T,3\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\nL(t)_0\\in3\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=0\\to\nL(t)_1\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=1\\to\n\\exists!s\\in\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\;\\top\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=2\\to\n\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S(c,X,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\n\\exists T,R,L,Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nc=\\langle T,R,L\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{WF}\n(\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\},T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,T,3\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\nL(t)_0\\in3\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=0\\to\nL(t)_1\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=1\\to\n\\exists!s\\in\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\;\\top\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=2\\to\n\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Label <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> is a basic-set leaf, label <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> a unary complement node, and label <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> a nonempty countable-union node. Well-foundedness uses the exact two-place source predicate on the reverse strict tree order.</li>\n<li>The label function has a set codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\\times Y\">\\(3\\times Y\\)</span>; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\\times V\">\\(3\\times V\\)</span> incorrectly treated a proper class as a set-valued function codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-countable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c,X,\\mathcal B,T,R,L,t,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Child}:V^3\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"(T,R,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code\\text{-}children}\\vdash\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in T:\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R\\land t\\neq s\\land\n\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(u\\neq t\\land u\\neq s\\land\n\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle u,s\\rangle\\in R)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescBorelCode}_S(c,X,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\n\\exists T,R,L,Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nc=\\langle T,R,L\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{WF}\n(\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in T\\times T:\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land x\\neq y\\},T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(L,T,3\\times Y)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\nL(t)_0\\in3\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=0\\to\nL(t)_1\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=1\\to\n\\exists!s\\in\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\;\\top\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad\\land\\bigl(L(t)_0=2\\to\n\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\operatorname{Child}(T,R,t))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"3\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"3\\times V","display":false}],"bytes":2276,"backlinks":[{"id":"f7960174147254b5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1794","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code.md|58-df-zfc-desc-borel-code]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9375de7089953a2b","f06e57c5c0b1354d","9e70b896da231f4f","36d7463d215be751","1b3610e6aed65b25"]}